==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Beastly Nero (Enemy)|Beastly Nero]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

